@startuml architecture
title legalSystem - Layered Architecture & Request/Event Flow
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
actor Scheduler as "Scheduler\n(@EnableScheduling)"

package "Spring Boot (com.dcm)" {
  [Controllers\n(rest/, main/)] as C
  [Services\n(service/)] as S
  [Repositories\n(repository/)] as R
  [Entities\n(modal/)] as M
  [Security\n(config/)] as SEC
  [Mail\n(mail/EmailServiceImpl)] as MAIL
}
database "MySQL\n(legal)" as DB

User --> C : HTTP (JSP views)
C --> S : delegates
S --> R : CRUD / @Query
R --> DB : JPA / Hibernate
R ..> M : maps rows
SEC --> S : authenticates (CustomUserDetailsService)
Scheduler --> MAIL : @Scheduled hearing/birthday reminders
MAIL --> User : email
@enduml
